                                        <h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
                                        <h3>What is Yoga Bar's biggest advantage?</h3>
                                        <p>Sisters-founded + India-made + accessible-premium + broad healthy snacks portfolio + ITC acquisition backing. Multi-dimensional healthy snacks advantage.</p>
                                        <h3>How much did ITC pay for Yoga Bar?</h3>
